# CURCUIT API Integration Context

## Project Overview
This project implements a RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) chatbot with a sophisticated LLM fallback system:

**Primary LLM:** Cisco CURCUIT API (cloud-based, OAuth2 authentication)  
**Backup LLM:** Local Ollama (offline capable)  
**Fallback LLM:** OpenAI (if configured)

## Key Integration Files
- [src/curcuit_api.py](mdc:src/curcuit_api.py) - CURCUIT API client with OAuth2 token management
- [src/chatbot.py](mdc:src/chatbot.py) - Main chatbot with intelligent fallback system
- [config.py](mdc:config.py) - Configuration management with CURCUIT settings
- [test_curcuit_integration.py](mdc:test_curcuit_integration.py) - Integration testing
- [check_env_mapping.py](mdc:check_env_mapping.py) - Environment validation

