## Configuration Pattern
Environment variables are loaded from `.env` file (git-ignored):
```bash
USE_CURCUIT_API=true
CURCUIT_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id
CURCUIT_CLIENT_SECRET=your_client_secret
CURCUIT_APP_KEY=your_app_key
CURCUIT_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
```

## Security Requirements
- `.env` file MUST be git-ignored (never committed)
- All credentials loaded via environment variables
- No hardcoded secrets in codebase
- OAuth2 tokens auto-refresh every hour

## LLM Fallback Flow
1. Try CURCUIT API (primary)
2. If fails → Try Ollama (backup)  
3. If fails → Try OpenAI (fallback)
4. If all fail → Error with helpful message

When answering questions about this project, always reference the current implementation and documentation in the `md/` directory.